11
01:00:12,631 --> 01:00:18,631
Club Dread (also known as Broken Lizard's Club Dread) is a 2004 comedy slasher film directed by Jay Chandrasekhar and written by and starring the
comedy troupe Broken Lizard, Chandrasekhar, Kevin Heffernan, Steve Lemme, Paul Soter, Erik Stolhanske, Brittany Daniel, and Bill Paxton.

12
01:05:41,052 --> 01:05:47,052
The film follows a group of staff members on a tropical island
resort, where an unknown killer begins a murder spree.

13
01:11:09,473 --> 01:11:15,473
It's an international co-production film between the United States and Mexico.

14
01:16:37,894 --> 01:16:43,894
Though the story is set on an island in Costa
Rica, filming took place in Mexico.

15
01:22:06,315 --> 01:22:12,315
Club Dread was released on February 27, 2004, and grossed $7.6 million at the box
office on a budget of $8.6 million, becoming a financial failure.

16
01:27:34,736 --> 01:27:40,736
The film received mixed-to-negative reviews from critics.

17
01:33:03,157 --> 01:33:09,157
The film explores themes of island, machete, beautiful
woman, serial killer, slasher spoof.

18
01:38:31,578 --> 01:38:37,578
The tone is intense and lighthearted and dark.
